  "definition": "Removal of Restriction",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-08-05",
  "historyNote": "#10176, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13685, eff 8-5-23 (formerly Saf-C 1008.08) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1000)",
